<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks fall to 212,744.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks fall to 212,744.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of May 21 totaled 212,744 bales, down from 213,255 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales issued, 772 bales awaiting review, 511 cancellations, and 8,074 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
